00:32:19.270 --> 00:32:21.310
She also makes short movies.

00:32:21.310 --> 00:32:24.650
And she also raps, by the way.

00:32:24.650 --> 00:32:25.946
I was just--

00:32:25.946 --> 00:32:26.820
MARK MANDEL: Awesome.

00:32:26.820 --> 00:32:28.650
MARGARET MITCHELL:
She's super inspiring.

00:32:28.650 --> 00:32:30.660
TIMNIT GEBRU: Again,
