00:33:29.670 --> 00:33:30.503
MELANIE WARRICK: OK.

00:33:30.503 --> 00:33:33.720
TIMNIT GEBRU: But the person
who-- well, the main people

00:33:33.720 --> 00:33:38.500
are Sorelle Friedler,
Suresh, and Solon Barocas.

00:33:38.500 --> 00:33:41.650
So if you go fatconference.org--

00:33:41.650 --> 00:33:42.900
I'm just a big fan.

00:33:42.900 --> 00:33:43.900
I always talk about it.

00:33:43.900 --> 00:33:46.806
I don't want people to think
