00:35:21.180 --> 00:35:24.490
could be translating a concept
that is very well known

00:35:24.490 --> 00:35:28.060
in one specific area to people
from a different specific area.

00:35:28.060 --> 00:35:31.120
So it could be translating
a very well known machine

00:35:31.120 --> 00:35:34.300
learning concept to
lawyers, or translating

00:35:34.300 --> 00:35:37.150
very well-known
things in health care

00:35:37.150 --> 00:35:39.010
to machine learning
people, so just

00:35:39.010 --> 00:35:41.555
kind of bridging
this gap of knowledge

00:35:41.555 --> 00:35:43.180
between the different
groups so that we

00:35:43.180 --> 00:35:45.670
can have some common
understanding and common ground

00:35:45.670 --> 00:35:47.140
to start working together.

