diversity, of course.

00:36:57.170 --> 00:37:01.240
But sometimes all of these
words are used as buzzwords.

00:37:01.240 --> 00:37:03.760
And sometimes they're
used for PR purposes.

00:37:03.760 --> 00:37:06.330
And sometimes they're
used for image purposes.

00:37:06.330 --> 00:37:08.530
So let me give an
example, if you

00:37:08.530 --> 00:37:13.240
have an all-male panel on AI
for Ethics or AI for Social Good

00:37:13.240 --> 00:37:15.610
or something like this,
I have very little faith

00:37:15.610 --> 00:37:18.520
