AI for Social Good.

00:37:18.520 --> 00:37:22.360
If you have an all-male team,
or a very homogeneous team,

00:37:22.360 --> 00:37:24.820
or you've never graduated a
female student, or something

00:37:24.820 --> 00:37:29.260
like this, and now people
are talking about AI ethics

00:37:29.260 --> 00:37:30.460
and things like that.

00:37:30.460 --> 00:37:32.990
So I think people say charity
